  "notes": "AFG International Company (a Saudi Joint Stock Company, previously Fawaz Abdulaziz Al Hokair & Co.; brand Cenomi Retail; ticker 4240) audited consolidated financial statements for the year ended 31 December 2025 with FY2024 comparatives, from the full audited PDF in the 'Annual / 2025' cell of the Saudi Exchange company-profile 'Financial Statements' tab (Resources/fsPdf/459_0_2026-03-16...). Auditor BDO (Dr. Mohamed Al-Amri & Co.). The auditor's report (printed pages 2-5) is a scanned image; the five primary statements and the notes (printed pages 6 onward) are digital text (transcribed from the text layer). Amounts are in full Saudi Riyals (scale 1). Board of Directors approved issuance on 23 Ramadan 1447 / 12 March 2026 (used as filed_at). The name change from Fawaz Abdulaziz Al Hokair & Co. to AFG International Company was approved by the EGM on 6 January 2026; intermediate parent Al-Futtaim Retail Company, ultimate parent Al-Futtaim Group LLC (UAE). The auditor's report contains a MATERIAL UNCERTAINTY RELATED TO GOING CONCERN (net loss SAR 497m, accumulated losses SAR 2,113m, current liabilities exceed current assets by SAR 1,545m, total liabilities exceed total assets by SAR 1,466m i.e. equity is negative) - opinion not modified. total_equity, equity_parent, noncontrolling_interests and retained_earnings (accumulated losses) are all negative. income_taxes_and_zakat is the single reported 'Zakat and Income tax expense' line. The reported 'Loss before zakat and income tax' is a continuing-operations figure; because IFRS 5 discontinued operations are presented net below the tax line, income_before_income_taxes_and_zakat is NOT carried as a fact (it would break the plain pre-tax minus tax equals net-income check). Instead continuing_operations_income and discontinued_operations_income are carried and net_income = continuing + discontinued is checked. discontinued_operations_income / continuing_operations_income are the reported split. other_reserves combines the foreign currency translation reserve and the fair value reserve. intangible_assets is the combined 'Goodwill and intangible assets' line (goodwill SAR 341m within it; goodwill impairment of SAR 120m for the year is carried as impairment_charges). long_term_investments is 'Investment in equity instruments at FVOCI'; investments_associates is 'Equity accounted investment'. long_term_debt / current_debt are the non-current / current 'Loans and borrowings'; related_party_loans is the current 'Shareholder's loan' (SAR 1,378m, nil in 2024); IFRS 16 lease liabilities are mapped separately. finance_costs is 'Net finance costs' (finance cost on loans and borrowings + on lease liabilities, plus a 2024 derivative loss). The non-current-assets and non-current-liabilities subtotals are deliberately NOT carried as facts: the group has IFRS 5 disposal groups (assets held for sale SAR 30.8m, liabilities held for sale SAR 36.2m) presented outside the current / non-current subtotals, so 'total = current + non-current' would not tie within tolerance; assets_held_for_sale / liabilities_held_for_sale are carried and the balance-sheet check runs on total_assets = total_liabilities + total_equity. depreciation_amortization sums depreciation of right-of-use assets, property and equipment, investment property and amortisation of intangible assets from the cash-flow statement. capex is 'Purchase of property and equipment'. interest_paid sums 'Payments of finance costs over loans and borrowings' and 'over lease liabilities'. zakat_paid is 'Zakat and income tax paid'. No ordinary dividend (loss-making). Statement page references are the printed page numbers: financial position 6, profit or loss 7, comprehensive income 8, changes in equity 9, cash flows 10-11.",
